    "detailed_description": "Pathogen: Survival is a wave based FPS zombie game that prioritises progression, customisation and freedom for different playstyles and includes:<br />\r\n- 21 upgradable abilities earned through in game currency<br />\r\n- 19 unique weapons earned through your character level<br />\r\n- 100s of unique skins, applicable to each attachment and element of the weapon, allowing for over 5 trillion possible skins for each weapon<br />\r\n- Character skin customisation<br />\r\n- Round based purchasable attachments<br />\r\n- Round based powerups<br />\r\n- Round based upgradable weapons, with 6 unique abilities (Fire, Ice, Blackhole, Electricity, Fortune, Wind)<br />\r\n- 8 zombie types, normal, spitter, butcher, wretch, baby, slobber, brute, radioactive brute<br />\r\n- 7 Unique maps<br />\r\n- Dash ability<br />\r\n- Adrenaline ability<br />\r\n- Time Warp ability<br />\r\n- Charged Jump ability<br />\r\n- 10 Unique Perks<br />\r\n- Weapon and Character Prestige levels",
